  "verseCount": 45,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "1",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "MRK 1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "1",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yohane Mʼbatizi Akonza Njira",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chiyambi cha Uthenga Wabwino wa Yesu Khristu, Mwana wa Mulungu,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "monga zalembedwera mʼbuku la mneneri Yesaya:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "MRK 1:2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"Ine ndidzatuma mthenga wanga patsogolo panu,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "MRK 1:2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "amene adzakonza njira yanu,\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Mawu a wofuwula mʼchipululu,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "MRK 1:3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "'Konzani njira ya Ambuye,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "MRK 1:3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "wongolani njira zake.' \"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "m"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipo Yohane anabwera mʼmadera a mʼchipululu nabatiza, ndi kulalikira za ubatizo wa kutembenuka mtima ndi wa chikhululukiro cha machimo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Madera onse a ku Yudeya ndi anthu onse a ku Yerusalemu anatuluka napita kwa iye. Akavomereza machimo awo, amawabatiza mu mtsinje wa Yorodani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yohane amavala zovala zopangidwa ndi ubweya wangamira, ndi lamba wachikopa mʼchiwuno mwake, ndipo amadya dzombe ndi uchi wamthengo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipo uthenga wake unali uwu: \"Pambuyo panga pakubwera wina wondiposa ine mphamvu. Ine si woyenera kuwerama ndi kumasula zingwe za nsapato zake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ine ndikubatizani ndi madzi, koma Iye adzakubatizani ndi Mzimu Woyera.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kubatizidwa ndi Kuyesedwa kwa Yesu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pa nthawi imeneyo Yesu anabwera kuchokera ku Nazareti wa ku Galileya ndipo anabatizidwa ndi Yohane mu mtsinje wa Yorodani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pamene Yesu ankatuluka mʼmadzi, anaona kumwamba kukutsekuka ndipo Mzimu Woyera akutsikira pa Iye ngati nkhunda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipo Mawu anamveka kuchokera kumwamba: \"Iwe ndiwe Mwana wanga wokondedwa; ndipo ndikondwera nawe.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nthawi yomweyo Mzimu Woyera anamutumiza Iye ku chipululu,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ndipo anali mʼchipululumo masiku makumi anayi, akuyesedwa ndi Satana. Anali pakati pa nyama zakuthengo; ndipo angelo anamutumikira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu Alengeza za Uthenga Wabwino",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yohane atamutsekera mʼndende, Yesu anapita ku Galileya nalalikira Uthenga Wabwino wa Mulungu nati,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"Nthawi yafika, ufumu wa Mulungu wayandikira. Tembenukani mtima ndi kukhulupirira Uthenga Wabwino!\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MRK.1.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MRK.1.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu Ayitana Ophunzira ake Oyamba",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pamene Yesu ankayenda mʼmbali mwa nyanja ya Galileya, anaona Simoni ndi mʼbale wake Andreya akuponya khoka mʼnyanja, popeza anali asodzi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu anati,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"Bwerani, tsateni Ine, ndipo ndidzakusandutsani asodzi a anthu.\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MRK.1.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MRK.1.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nthawi yomweyo anasiya makoka awo namutsata Iye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atapita patsogolo pangʼono, anaona Yakobo ndi mʼbale wake Yohane ana a Zebedayo, ali mʼbwato akukonza makoka awo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mosataya nthawi anawayitana, ndipo anasiya abambo awo Zebedayo ndi anyamata aganyu ali mʼbwatomo, namutsata Iye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu Atulutsa Mzimu Woyipa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iwo anapita ku Kaperenawo, ndipo tsiku la Sabata litafika, Yesu analowa mʼsunagoge nayamba kuphunzitsa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anthu anadabwa ndi chiphunzitso chake, chifukwa anawaphunzitsa ngati munthu amene anali ndi ulamuliro, osati ngati aphunzitsi amalamulo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pomwepo munthu wina mʼsunagogemo amene anali wogwidwa ndi mzimu woyipa anafuwula kuti,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Mukufuna chiyani kwa ife, Yesu wa ku Nazareti? Kodi mwabwera kudzatiwononga? Ndikudziwa kuti ndinu ndani, ndinu Woyerayo wa Mulungu!\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu anadzudzula chiwandacho mwamphamvu nati,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"Khala chete! Tuluka mwa iye!\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MRK.1.25",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MRK.1.25"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mzimu woyipawo unamugwedeza mwamphamvu ndipo unatuluka mwa iye ukufuwula.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anthu anadabwa kwambiri kotero kuti anafunsana wina ndi mnzake kuti, \"Ichi nʼchiyani? Chiphunzitso chatsopano ndi ulamuliro! Iye akulamula, ngakhale mizimu yoyipa ikumumvera.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbiri yake inafalikira kudera lonse la Galileya mofulumira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu Achiritsa Anthu Ambiri",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atangochoka mu sunagoge, Yesu pamodzi ndi Yakobo ndi Yohane anakalowa mʼnyumba ya Simoni ndi Andreya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mpongozi wa Simoni anali chigonere akudwala malungo, ndipo anamuwuza Yesu za iye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipo Yesu anapita kwa iye, namugwira dzanja namuthandiza kudzuka. Malungo anachoka ndipo anayamba kuwatumikira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Madzulo omwewo dzuwa litalowa anthu anabweretsa kwa Yesu anthu onse odwala ndi ogwidwa ndi ziwanda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anthu onse a mʼmudzimo anasonkhana pa khomo,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu anachiritsa ambiri amene anali ndi matenda osiyanasiyana, komanso anatulutsa ziwanda zambiri, ndipo sanalole kuti ziwandazo ziyankhule chifukwa zinkamudziwa Iye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu Apemphera Kumalo a Yekha",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mmamawa, kukanali kamdima, Yesu anadzuka, nachoka pa nyumbapo kupita kumalo kwa yekha, kumene anakapemphera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Simoni ndi anzake anapita kokamufunafuna Iye,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ndipo atamupeza, anamuwuza kuti, \"Aliyense akukufunani!\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu anayakha kuti,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"Tiyeni tipite kwina ku midzi ya pafupi kuti ndikalalikirenso kumeneko. Ichi ndi chifukwa chimene ndinabwerera.\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MRK.1.38",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MRK.1.38"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Potero anayendayenda mu Galileya, kulalikira mʼmasunagoge awo ndi kutulutsa ziwanda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu Achiritsa Wakhate",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munthu wakhate anabwera kwa Iye, nagwada, namupempha kuti, \"Ngati mukufuna, mukhoza kundiyeretsa.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu pomva naye chifundo, anatambasula dzanja lake namukhudza munthuyo nati,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"Ndikufuna, yeretsedwa!\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MRK.1.41",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MRK.1.41"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nthawi yomweyo khate linachoka ndipo anachiritsidwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.42"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nthawi yomweyo Yesu anamuwuza kuti apite koma anamuchenjeza kuti,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"Wonetsetsa kuti usawuze aliyense za zimenezi. Koma pita, kadzionetse wekha kwa wansembe ndi kukapereka nsembe zimene Mose analamulira zotsimikizira kuyeretsedwa kwanu, ngati umboni kwa iwo.\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MRK.1.44",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MRK.1.44"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mʼmalo mwake anapita nayamba kuyankhula momasuka, nafalitsa mbiriyo. Zotsatira zake, Yesu sanathe kulowa mʼmudzi moonekera, koma anakhala kunja kumalo kopanda anthu. Komabe anthu amabwera kwa Iye kuchokera kulikonse.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.45"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
